Include bonus and unemployment benefits
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_InMin
Lowest income in labor market
Include bonus and unemployment benefit
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_Lc
Work force (labor) size employed by consumption-good sector
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_LcBas
Work force (labor) size employed by basic consumption-good subsector
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_LcLux
Work force (labor) size employed by basic consumption-good subsector
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_LdC
Total labor demand in consumption-good sector
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_Lent
Entry rate of workers in labor market
Hires over total labor supply
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_Lexit
Exit rate of workers in labor market
Fires plus quits over labor employed
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_Llarg
Number of workers of largest firm in consumption-good sector
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_Lpart
Participation rate of the work force
Employed workers plus looking for jobs over labor force
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_TuAvg
Average number of periods of unemployment
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_V
Vacancy rate in labor market
(unfilled positions over total labour supply)
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_Wc
Total wages paid in consumption-good sector
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_dw
Nominal wage growth rate
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_noWrk
Share of operating firms with no worker in consumption-good sector
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_noWrkC
Share of operating firms with no worker hired in consumption-good sector
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_noWrkCbas
Share of operating firms with no worker in basic consumption-good subsector
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_noWrkClux
Share of operating firms with no worker in luxury consumption-good subsector
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_wAvgLarg
Average wage paid by largest firm in consumption-good sector
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_wAvgReal
Real average wage of employed workers (cpi adjusted)
Exclude bonus and unemployment benefit
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_wCavg
Weighted-average wage paid in consumption-good sector
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_wCavgBas
Weighted-average wage paid in basic consumption-good subsector
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_wCavgLux
Weighted-average wage paid in luxury consumption-good subsector
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_wCrealPosChg
Weighted average wage paid by post-change firms in consumption-good sector
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_wCrealPreChg
Weighted average wage paid by pre-change firms in consumption-good sector
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_wGini
Workers wage Gini index 
Jasso-Deaton formula
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_wMax
Highest wage of employed workers
Exclude bonus and unemployment benefit
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_wMin
Lowest wage of employed workers
Exclude bonus and unemployment benefit
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_wrAvg
Average requested wage
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_wrLogSD
Requested log wage standard deviation
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_wrMax
Highest requested wage in labor market
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_wrMin
Lowest requested wage in labor market
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_wsAvg
Average satisficing wage
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_wsLogSD
Satisficing log wage standard deviation
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_wsMax
Highest satisficing wage
END_DESCRIPTION

Variable_wsMin
Lowest satiscificing wage in labor market
END_DESCRIPTION


DOCUOBSERVE
